ad has been verified, and only remain accessible for the duration of the workflow. Every request for access is recorded in your `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://support.1password.com/activity-log/`,children:`audit log`}),`.`]}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`2`,id:`add-an-integration`,children:`Add an integration`}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`Before team members can connect their Environments to machine workflows, an administrator must set up an integration in 1Password Business.`}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`To set up an integration:`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.ol,{children:[`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`As an administrator, `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://start.1password.com/signin`,children:`sign in`}),` on 1Password.com, then select `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://start.1password.com/developer-tools`,children:_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Developer`})}),` in the sidebar.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`Select the `,_jsxs(_components.a,{href:`https://start.1password.com/developer-tools/active/agents-workloads`,children:[_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Agents \u0026 workflows`}),` tab`]}),`, then select `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Set up integrations`}),`.`,`\n`,_jsx(Tip,{children:_jsxs(_components.p,{children:[`If you’ve already set up an integration and want to add another, select `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Manage integrations`}),` > `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Add Integration`}),`.`]})}),`\n`]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.li,{children:`Choose one of the available integrations, then follow the steps for your integration below.`}),`\n`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(Tabs,{groupId:`integrations`,children:[_jsxs(Tab,{title:`GitHub Actions`,id:`github-actions`,children:[_jsx(_components.p,{children:`Before you connect your 1Password Business account to your GitHub organization, review the following requirements:`}),_jsxs(_components.ul,{children:[`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`Your `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.github.com/organizations/collaborating-with-groups-in-organizations/about-organizations`,children:`GitHub organization`}),` must be hosted on GitHub.com. GitHub organizations hosted on `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.github.com/enterprise-server@latest/admin/overview/about-github-enterprise-server`,children:`GitHub Enterprise Server`}),` or `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.github.com/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/data-residency/about-github-enterprise-cloud-with-data-residency`,children:`GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency`}),` aren’t currently supported.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`If you use `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.github.com/get-started/learning-about-github/githubs-plans#github-free-for-organizations`,children:`GitHub Free for organizations`}),`, your team won’t be able to use this integration for workflows in private repositories.`]}),`\n`]}),_jsx(_components.p,{children:`If your GitHub organization meets the requirements, follow these steps:`}),_jsxs(_components.ol,{children:[`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`Enter a name for the integration and the name of the GitHub organization you want to connect, then select `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Create integration`}),`.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`The token value is your integration key, which is required to decrypt secrets in your team’s workflows. Save this key in 1Password for future reference, then follow the steps to `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.github.com/en/codespaces/managing-codespaces-for-your-organization/managing-development-environment-secrets-for-your-repository-or-organization#adding-secrets-for-an-organization`,children:`add a new secret for your GitHub organization.`}),` Set the secret name to `,_jsx(_components.code,{children:`OP_INTEGRATION_KEY`}),` and the value to your integration key.`]}),`\n`]})]}),_jsx(Tab,{title:`Custom Workflow (OIDC)`,id:`custom-workflow-oidc`,children:_jsxs(_components.ol,{children:[`\n`,_jsx(_components.li,{children:`Enter a name for the integration, then enter your OIDC provider’s issuer URL.`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`Select `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Verify`}),`. If your JWKS endpoint isn’t detected automatically, enter the URL manually, then select `,_jsx(_components.strong,{children:`Continue`}),`.`]}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`Define the identity requirements (claims) that must be met to verify a workload. All configured claims must match to verify the workload’s identity. For example, you can use them to restrict secrets to `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.gitlab.com/ci/secrets/id_token_authentication/#token-payload`,children:`GitLab CI/CD jobs running in a specific project, branch, environment, etc.`})]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.li,{children:`Make note of the expected audience value. Your team members will need to declare this when their workflows request an OIDC token.`}),`\n`,_jsxs(_components.li,{children:[`The token value is your integration key, which is required to decrypt secrets in your team’s workflows. Save this key in 1Password for future reference, then configure the key as a secret that can be retrieved at runtime. For example, you can configure it as a `,_jsx(_components.a,{href:`https://docs.gitlab.com/ci/variables/#for-a-group`,children:`CI/CD variable in a GitLab group`}),`, so the team members in that group can retrieve it with its variable name.`]}),`\n`]})})]}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`After you’ve set up an integration, your team can start connecting their 1Password Environments to their workflows:`}),`\n`,_jsxs(Columns,{cols:2,children:[_jsx(_MdxComponentBoundary,{name:`HighlightCard`,children:_jsx(HighlightCard,{title:`GitHub Actions`,link:{to:`/brokered-access/github-actions/`,text:`Learn more`},preheader:``,useButton:false,children:_jsx(`p`,{children:`Learn how to configure GitHub Actions workflows to retrieve secrets from 1Password Enviro